{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "https://excalidraw.com", "elements": [{"id": "e1", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": -60, "width": 509.6, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 907792446, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 280370307, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "03 · Форма брони (/venues/:id/book)", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 26, "containerId": null, "originalText": "03 · Форма брони (/venues/:id/book)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e2", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 900, "height": 680, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 556624391, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 393740902, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 940, "y": 0, "width": 380, "height": 680, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 975235190, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 179360018, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e4", "type": "text", "x": 956, "y": 12, "width": 241.92000000000002, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 381925852, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 828862022, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Поля из базы на этом экране", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 16, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Поля из базы на этом экране", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e5", "type": "text", "x": 956, "y": 44, "width": 371.28000000000003, "height": 292.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 239221898, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 571866730, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Что клиент выбирает:\nbookings.start_at — дата и час начала\nbookings.end_at = start_at + hours\nbookings.comment — комментарий (необязательно)\n\nЧто считает сервер (клиент не присылает):\nbookings.total_price = price_per_hour × hours (БП6)\nbookings.status = PENDING (после отправки)\nbookings.user_id — из токена\n\nЧто берём для показа:\nvenues.name, venues.price_per_hour\n\nPOST /bookings {venue_id, start_at, hours, comment}\n  201 → переход в «Мои брони»\n  409 → «Время только что заняли» (остаёмся\n        на форме, список времени обновляется)\n  400 → понятный текст правила, которое нарушено", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Что клиент выбирает:\nbookings.start_at — дата и час начала\nbookings.end_at = start_at + hours\nbookings.comment — комментарий (необязательно)\n\nЧто считает сервер (клиент не присылает):\nbookings.total_price = price_per_hour × hours (БП6)\nbookings.status = PENDING (после отправки)\nbookings.user_id — из токена\n\nЧто берём для показа:\nvenues.name, venues.price_per_hour\n\nPOST /bookings {venue_id, start_at, hours, comment}\n  201 → переход в «Мои брони»\n  409 → «Время только что заняли» (остаёмся\n        на форме, список времени обновляется)\n  400 → понятный текст правила, которое нарушено", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e6", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 900, "height": 50, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 581503268, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 836503817, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e7", "type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 15, "width": 100.80000000000001, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 539766819, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 353975089, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "SportBook", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 20, "containerId": null, "originalText": "SportBook", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e8", "type": "text", "x": 560, "y": 17, "width": 125.44000000000001, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 683374320, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 239489169, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Клиент: Айдар Н.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 14, "containerId": null, "originalText":